    "shallow.designResistance": "SP 22.13330.2016 5.6.7 Eq 5.7; Table 5.5 Mγ, Mq, Mc by φII (here every degree 0-45° from the closed form Mq = 1 + π/(cot φ + φ - π/2), Mc = π cot φ/(cot φ + φ - π/2), Mγ = (π/4)/(cot φ + φ - π/2), equal to the table to its rounding: U); Table 5.4 γc1: 1.25 (sands other than silty saturated ones; 1.4 coarse sands, 1.1 silty saturated not told apart, U), 1.1 (clays of IL > 0.5, on the safe side of 1.25 / 1.2, P); γc2 1.0 (flexible structural scheme); k 1.1 (the strength from tables or correlations, not tests); kz = 1 for b < 10 m, z0/b + 0.2 with z0 8 m above (U); d1 the founding depth below the borehole's ground, γ'II = σ'v/d1"
